
load @cluesurf/base/code/proof/equal
  find equal

task make
  firm true
  head A
  take P
    like task
      take value, like A
  take x, like A
  take y, like A
  take proof, like equal A x y
  take base
    call P
      bind value, read x
  fork case, read proof
    case refl
      send back, read base
